555c-7cf9-8998-36a7fbe8312d","description":"Influential Christian saint and writer, who shaped much of Western Christian thought.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-76e1-b059-dd78c5610f9f","description":"Victoria era novelist who wrote many popular books.","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7d85-8796-0e7f2afaa997","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What word is used when a candidate receives an overwhelming majority of votes in an election?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"In election coverage, a landslide means a decisive victory by a very large margin, borrowing the image of a powerful mass sweeping downhill.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-555c-72fd-b1b8-3d09c7ea414e","description":"Landslide","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7ac6-82fe-0a6817dc9435","description":"Tsunami","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7a84-97ed-81cdbc8b2a84","description":"Firestorm","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7b2b-bf86-e3162e868b85","description":"Stampede","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-715f-ba3c-b4e19887168d","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these is a four-sided spinning top, played during the Jewish holiday of Hanukkah?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A dreidel is often played with a shared pot of tokens, such as chocolate coins; the letter facing up determines what a player does with the pot.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-555c-793b-8d80-e366851bf548","description":"A dreidel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7b95-a93e-d40ff222f143","description":"A menorah","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-74dc-b66c-61e0973c0964","description":"A Torah scroll","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-723f-9af2-7074b9a1e327","description":"A shofar","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-752a-8635-76b20d24c0ee","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the slang term for removing body hair from men?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Manscaping blends \u201cman\u201d with \u201clandscaping\u201d to describe styling or removing men\u2019s body hair.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7392-a598-7fd3f54ff005","description":"Manscaping","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-79b6-b7f4-b97fb3316eb1","description":"Bodyculture","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7974-ac12-3fd308dacb29","description":"Topihairy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-75ec-bd25-7c0f2b0859a5","description":"Guydening","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7607-8e45-f3c92293bb4a","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the name of the bandaged walking dead often seen during Halloween, whose name comes from the Persian word for \'wax\'?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A mummy is a preserved body; ancient Egyptian embalmers used natron to dry bodies before wrapping them in linen.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7093-ab4a-5d7450928f93","description":"A mummy","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-70e8-8b86-67605bf9168f","description":"A zombie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7cf9-9bcb-18bf3b9734f1","description":"A skeleton","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7ed6-83ba-9937bdbc3f5f","description":"A vampire","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-71af-8fef-d74559b21223","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What did \'my true love give to me\' on the first day of Christmas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A Partridge in a Pear Tree is the gift in the carol\u2019s opening verse. Each succeeding verse adds gifts while repeating those already named.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-555c-77ce-a292-3a043aab5293","description":"A Partridge In A Pear Tree","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7a61-a7f8-8ade217a91b1","description":"5 Gold Rings","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb