 Roberts","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7534-93de-a2de86bed9b0","description":"Patricia Anne Reynolds","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7136-bdff-e84f660239a1","description":"Margaret Louise Turner","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7c90-9161-971a3e0b9384","description":"Dorothy Jane Crawford","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-77be-82ae-3ef1687ecb9e","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which marketing slogan would you associate with Gillette?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Gillette introduced \u201cThe Best a Man Can Get\u201d in 1989, and the tagline became closely associated with its advertising.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7c56-97a1-335f02ade9c4","description":"The Best a Man Can Get","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-758e-bd58-9674c80384ff","description":"Quality never goes out of style","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7d70-9b45-e0258858ef69","description":"Easy, breezy, beautiful\u2026.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-71da-aa48-8474e4b32cbe","description":"Maybe she\'s born with it","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7546-a35b-da9e019a85e0","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which former US president\'s wife is called Michelle?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Barack Obama was the first Black president of the United States, and Michelle Obama served as first lady during his two terms.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-555c-735e-9e94-8b9507796f0a","description":"Barack Obama","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7983-bd15-41f2edc67cfb","description":"Bill Clinton","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7117-8a4d-f68519ca2b53","description":"George Bush","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-7c04-95ce-d3f51051e970","description":"Donald Trump","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-555c-726d-bdd7-f49212963a3c","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b48